擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-124.8,"default_fair_val":-124.8,"premium_pct":-114.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":12.3,"pe_forward":10.8,"pb_trailing":0.9,"pb_forward":0.8,"div_yield":15.03,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":0.38,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":89.1,"cash_to_assets":1.5,"current_ratio":0.03,"roe":7.2,"roa":0.8,"moat":{"ticker":"NLY","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"NLY 作為抵押貸款 REIT，其品牌價值與定價權極為有限。公司主要依賴於市場利率和信貸環境，而非獨特的品牌或定價能力。其產品本質上是金融服務，與其他抵押貸款機構高度同質化，缺乏顯著的品牌溢價空間。客戶選擇主要基於利率和服務條款，而非品牌忠誠度，這使得其在品牌定價方面幾乎沒有護城河。","comment_en":"Annaly Capital Management (NLY), as a mortgage REIT, possesses very limited brand value and pricing power. The company's performance is primarily driven by market interest rates and credit conditions, rather than unique branding or pricing capabilities. Its offerings are essentially financial services, highly commoditized compared to other mortgage lenders, leaving little room for brand premium. Customer choices are predominantly based on interest rates and service terms, not brand loyalty, resulting in virtually no moat in brand pricing."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NLY 營運於金融服務業，特別是抵押貸款 REITs，此行業幾乎不存在專利或獨特的監管壁壘。其業務模式高度依賴於公開市場的利率和證券化產品，並無受專利保護的技術或獨家許可。雖然 REITs 的結構有其監管框架，但這並非 NLY 獨有的競爭優勢，其他同業亦可進入。因此，在專利和監管方面，NLY 的護城河極為薄弱。","comment_en":"NLY operates in the financial services sector, specifically as a mortgage REIT. This industry offers virtually no patents or unique regulatory barriers. Its business model heavily relies on public market interest rates and securitized products, with no patent-protected technology or exclusive licenses. While the REIT structure has a regulatory framework, this is not a unique competitive advantage for NLY; other industry players can also operate under similar regulations. Consequently, NLY's moat in patents and regulatory protection is extremely weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"對於 NLY 而言，客戶轉換成本相對較低。雖然更換抵押貸款服務提供商可能涉及一些文書工作和時間成本，但對於尋求最佳利率或服務的客戶來說，這些成本通常不足以構成顯著的約束。尤其是在利率變動頻繁的市場中，客戶更傾向於尋找最有利的交易。因此，NLY 在客戶轉換成本方面缺乏強大的護城河。","comment_en":"For NLY, customer switching costs are relatively low. While changing mortgage service providers might involve some paperwork and time, these costs are generally insufficient to act as a significant deterrent for customers seeking the best rates or services. Especially in a market with frequent interest rate fluctuations, customers are more inclined to pursue the most favorable deals. Therefore, NLY lacks a strong moat in terms of customer switching costs."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務模式不具備網絡效應。其作為抵押貸款 REIT，主要從事購買和管理抵押貸款支持證券（MBS）及相關資產。這種業務不涉及用戶數量增加而導致的價值提升。例如，更多的借款人或投資者並不會直接增加 NLY 自身業務的價值或吸引力。因此，網絡效應並非 NLY 的護城河。","comment_en":"NLY's business model does not exhibit network effects. As a mortgage REIT, it primarily engages in purchasing and managing mortgage-backed securities (MBS) and related assets. This type of business does not involve value enhancement through an increase in user numbers. For instance, more borrowers or investors do not directly increase the value or attractiveness of NLY's own operations. Therefore, network effects do not constitute a moat for NLY."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NLY 作為行業內最大的抵押貸款 REIT 之一，確實享有一定的規模經濟優勢。龐大的資產規模使其在融資、交易執行和管理費用上可能比小型競爭對手更具效率。然而，抵押貸款市場本身競爭激烈，且利率波動是主要驅動因素，規模優勢的轉化為持續的超額利潤能力有限。其成本優勢相對穩固，但不足以形成難以逾越的壁壘。","comment_en":"As one of the largest mortgage REITs in the industry, NLY does benefit from certain economies of scale. Its substantial asset base may provide advantages in financing, transaction execution, and management costs compared to smaller competitors. However, the mortgage market is inherently competitive, and interest rate volatility is a primary driver. The translation of scale advantages into sustained excess profitability is limited. While its cost advantage is relatively stable, it does not form an insurmountable barrier."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務模式並非基於地理位置或獨特的實體資產。其投資組合主要由抵押貸款支持證券組成，這些證券可以在全國乃至全球範圍內交易。公司並無依賴特定地理區域的房地產或資源，其價值來源於金融市場的利率和信貸風險管理，而非獨特的地理位置或資產。因此，在這一維度上，NLY 沒有護城河。","comment_en":"NLY's business model is not based on geographical location or unique physical assets. Its investment portfolio primarily consists of mortgage-backed securities, which are tradable nationally and globally. The company does not rely on real estate or resources in specific geographic areas; its value stems from interest rate and credit risk management in financial markets, not unique locations or assets. Therefore, NLY has no moat in this dimension."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NLY 在營運效率方面表現相對穩健，這得益於其作為大型 REIT 的經驗和專業化管理。公司能夠有效管理龐大的資產組合，並在複雜的金融市場中進行交易和對沖。其營運效率體現在對市場波動的反應速度和風險控制能力上。雖然金融市場的本質使其難以建立絕對的營運壁壘，但 NLY 的專業化運營能力為其提供了一定的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"NLY demonstrates relatively robust operational efficiency, attributed to its experience and specialized management as a large REIT. The company effectively manages a vast asset portfolio and engages in trading and hedging within complex financial markets. Its operational efficiency is reflected in its responsiveness to market volatility and risk control capabilities. While the nature of financial markets makes absolute operational moats difficult to establish, NLY's specialized operational expertise provides it with a degree of competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NLY 的資本配置能力是其相對較強的護城河之一。作為一家成熟的 REIT，公司需要持續有效地配置資本以產生收益和增長。這包括對不同類型抵押貸款證券的選擇、融資結構的優化以及股息政策的制定。成功的資本配置需要對市場有深刻的理解和精準的判斷，NLY 在此方面積累了豐富的經驗，能夠在複雜的利率環境中尋找機會，為股東創造價值。","comment_en":"NLY's capital allocation capability represents one of its relatively strong moats. As a mature REIT, the company must continuously and effectively allocate capital to generate returns and growth. This involves selecting different types of mortgage securities, optimizing financing structures, and formulating dividend policies. Successful capital allocation requires a deep understanding of the market and precise judgment. NLY has accumulated extensive experience in this area, enabling it to identify opportunities within complex interest rate environments and create value for shareholders."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"NLY 的客戶主要是機構投資者和金融機構，而非傳統意義上的零售客戶。因此，'客戶保留'的概念在此有所不同。其業務的穩定性更多依賴於其融資渠道的暢通和投資組合的表現，而非客戶的忠誠度。雖然與某些交易對手可能存在長期合作關係，但這些關係並非基於難以打破的承諾，更多是基於當前的市場條件和 NLY 的吸引力。因此，客戶保留並非其核心護城河。","comment_en":"NLY's clients are primarily institutional investors and financial institutions, rather than traditional retail customers. Thus, the concept of 'customer retention' differs here. The stability of its business relies more on the smooth functioning of its financing channels and the performance of its investment portfolio, rather than customer loyalty. While long-term relationships may exist with certain counterparties, these are not based on unbreakable commitments but rather on current market conditions and NLY's attractiveness. Therefore, customer retention is not a core moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"NLY 的業務模式具有一定的週期性，其盈利能力高度依賴於利率環境和宏觀經濟狀況。雖然其作為 REIT 的結構提供了一定的稅收優惠和穩定的現金流分配機制，但其資產（主要是 MBS）的價值會隨著利率變化而波動。這種對外部經濟因素的高度敏感性限制了其業務的長期穩定性和可預測性。因此，其護城河的持久性中等。","comment_en":"NLY's business model is somewhat cyclical, with its profitability heavily dependent on the interest rate environment and macroeconomic conditions. While its REIT structure offers certain tax advantages and a stable cash flow distribution mechanism, the value of its assets (primarily MBS) fluctuates with interest rate changes. This high sensitivity to external economic factors limits the long-term stability and predictability of its business. Consequently, the durability of its moat is moderate."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Annaly Capital Management (NLY) 作為一家抵押貸款 REIT，其經濟護城河相當薄弱，主要體現為一種『商品型』或『收費橋』的商業模式，而非具有強大品牌或網絡效應的特許經營權。其相對較強的優勢在於規模經濟帶來的成本效率、專業化的營運能力以及資本配置的經驗。然而，這些優勢在高度競爭且受利率環境劇烈影響的市場中，難以形成持久且難以逾越的壁壘。公司缺乏專利、品牌忠誠度或顯著的客戶轉換成本，使其易受市場波動影響。總體而言，NLY 的護城河更多是基於其在特定金融市場中的專業運營和規模，而非內在的、可持續的競爭優勢。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Annaly Capital Management (NLY) operates as a mortgage REIT with a notably weak economic moat, best characterized as a 'commodity' or 'toll bridge' business model rather than a franchise with strong branding or network effects. Its relative strengths lie in cost efficiencies derived from scale, specialized operational capabilities, and capital allocation expertise. However, these advantages struggle to form a durable and insurmountable barrier in a highly competitive market heavily influenced by interest rate environments. The company lacks patents, brand loyalty, or significant customer switching costs, making it susceptible to market volatility. Overall, NLY's moat is more rooted in its professional operations and scale within specific financial markets than in inherent, sustainable competitive advantages.","evidenceHash":"e9e4e60f28c7447109b232f61947287c9243c31bf60a92e9fe1564559e276764","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"7b038374c0bfdab41a8c3c21e139c28acc7f0958cc24996092901773209cf797"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"7b038374c0bfdab41a8c3c21e139c28acc7f0958cc24996092901773209cf797"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NLY.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NLY.png","website":"https://www.annaly.com","ceo":"David L. Finkelstein","full_time_employees":"212","description":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) operates as a multifaceted financial firm, specializing in managing capital across various sectors. Its core business encompasses mortgage-related investments and lending to middle-market corporations. NLY strategically deploys capital across a diverse range of assets, including government-sponsored (Agency) and privately-issued (non-Agency) mortgage-backed securities, residential and commercial mortgage loans, mortgage servicing rights, credit risk transfer instruments, corporate debt, and other commercial real estate investments. Operating as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), Annaly benefits from a particular tax structure. This designation exempts it from federal corporate income tax, provided it distributes the majority of its taxable earnings to its investors. Established in 1996, the firm's corporate headquarters are located in New York City.","description_en":"Annaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) operates as a multifaceted financial firm, specializing in managing capital across various sectors. Its core business encompasses mortgage-related investments and lending to middle-market corporations. NLY strategically deploys capital across a diverse range of assets, including government-sponsored (Agency) and privately-issued (non-Agency) mortgage-backed securities, residential and commercial mortgage loans, mortgage servicing rights, credit risk transfer instruments, corporate debt, and other commercial real estate investments. Operating as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), Annaly benefits from a particular tax structure. This designation exempts it from federal corporate income tax, provided it distributes the majority of its taxable earnings to its investors. Established in 1996, the firm's corporate headquarters are located in New York City.","description_zh":"**Annaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) 業務營運精煉**\n\nAnnaly Capital Management, Inc. (NLY) 是一家多元化的金融機構，專注於管理跨領域的資本。其核心業務涵蓋抵押貸款相關投資及對中型企業的放款。NLY 策略性地將資本配置於多樣化的資產類別，包括政府贊助（Agency）及私人發行（non-Agency）的抵押貸款擔保證券（MBS）、住宅及商業抵押貸款、抵押貸款服務權（MSR）、信用風險移轉工具、企業債務，以及其他商業不動產投資。\n\n作為一家不動產投資信託（REIT），Annaly 受惠於特殊的稅務結構，若將大部分應稅收益分配予股東，可免除聯邦企業所得稅。該公司成立於 1996 年，總部位於紐約市。其營運模式著重於透過槓桿操作及利率價差來產生收益，並透過多元化的資產組合來分散風險。","address":"1211 Avenue of the Americas","city":"New York City","state":"NY","zip":"10036","country":"US","phone":"212 696 0100","full_address":"1211 Avenue of the Americas, New York City, NY 10036, US","range_52w":"17.7-24.52","year_high":24.52,"year_low":17.7,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":17.7,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-08-04","name":"Finkelstein David L","title":"director, officer: CEO and  Co-CIO","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":50000,"price":22.89,"total_val":1.14},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Hamilton Thomas Edward","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Hannan Kathy Hopinkah","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Laguerre Martin","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"VOTEK GLENN","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Laroche Manon","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Williams Vicki","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Wede Scott","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-06-12","name":"Reeves Eric A.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":8641,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-